<title>FRANCE: Andre buyout offer on Creeks opens Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Andre buyout offer on Creeks opens Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 70 franc per share buyout bid by Groupe Andre for minority shareholders of its Creeks subsidiary will proceed from Tuesday until March 25, the French stockmarkets association SBF said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said Creeks shares will resume quoting on the secondary market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
